    {
      "id": "DYH3b2BYoYy8JaYd_s6_N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1932.8508679832769,
      "y": -224.82430803394186,
      "width": 950.7598876953125,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bgy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 236165834,
      "version": 311,
      "versionNonce": 1943935866,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777009523854,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CFG： 先用 T5 分别编码两份文本条件\n  - 再让主生成模型 WanModel 分别跑两次\n  - 最后在噪声预测上做线性组合\n  noise_pred = noise_pred_uncond + guide_scale * (\n      noise_pred_cond - noise_pred_uncond)\n\nnoise_pred_cond：正向 prompt 条件下的噪声预测\n  - noise_pred_uncond：负向 prompt 条件下的噪声预测\n  - guide_scale：引导强度\nfinal = scale * pos - (scale - 1) * neg\n\nnoise_pred_uncond 里就包含“往这些特征方向走”的倾向。\n  CFG 在做： pos - neg 时，相当于把这些方向减掉。\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CFG： 先用 T5 分别编码两份文本条件\n  - 再让主生成模型 WanModel 分别跑两次\n  - 最后在噪声预测上做线性组合\n  noise_pred = noise_pred_uncond + guide_scale * (\n      noise_pred_cond - noise_pred_uncond)\n\nnoise_pred_cond：正向 prompt 条件下的噪声预测\n  - noise_pred_uncond：负向 prompt 条件下的噪声预测\n  - guide_scale：引导强度\nfinal = scale * pos - (scale - 1) * neg\n\nnoise_pred_uncond 里就包含“往这些特征方向走”的倾向。\n  CFG 在做： pos - neg 时，相当于把这些方向减掉。\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
